  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: jackson-databind 2.13.4.2-rhlw-00004",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind 2.13.4.2-rhlw-00004 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2026-91776: jackson-databind: unbounded growth of the type id cache in TypeDeserializerBase retains every unknown raw type ID\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind 2.13.4.2 from Maven Central.",
